From 251c025cb212ee420bb44f6dcbf7081e91b0ea91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 19:32:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: authorize a single-credential decoy switch and
 warm-start the target

Squash of former patches:

- 0043 test: add coverage for the decoy switch authorization store
- 0044 sovereignos: implement the decoy switch authorization store
- 0045 test: add coverage for consuming the decoy switch authorization
- 0046 test: register ActivityManagerInternal mock for foreground-switch tests
- 0047 sovereignos: skip the keyguard for an authorized switch
- 0048 sovereignos: expose the decoy switch authorization mint via ActivityManagerInternal
- 0049 sovereignos: add DecoyRoutingFailureMarker for the seamless-switch fallback path
- 0050 sovereignos: add check-credential-routing-status shell command
- 0051 sovereignos: mint the decoy switch authorization before replying, switch after
- 0052 sovereignos: warm-start the registered decoy target when the keyguard appears
- 0053 sovereignos: wire the credential-routing warm start into systemReady
- 0054 sovereignos: fix the warm start to use the real background-start API
- 0055 sovereignos: stop an unused warm-started decoy on real credential match
- 0056 test: add coverage for dual-grant decoy switch authorization consumption
- 0057 test: pass LockSettingsStorage mock to LockSettingsShellCommand constructor
